    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Institute for Human Development (IHD) in partnership with the Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC) conducted a three-day training on 'Data Journalism' for journalists based in the coastal region. The training aimed at empowering journalists with skills on how to appropriately analyse information, find insights and produce stories from research data. More than 38 journalists participated with a special focus on representatives from community media organizations.",
